  <li id="thy-r2"><span class="rf-for">Hipparcos と銀河座標</span><span class="rf-src">ESA, <i>The Hipparcos and Tycho Catalogues</i>, ESA SP-1200, 1997</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r3"><span class="rf-for">長期の歳差</span><span class="rf-src">J. Vondrák, N. Capitaine, and P. Wallace, “New precession expressions, valid for long time intervals,” <i>Astronomy &amp; Astrophysics</i>, vol. 534, A22, 2011</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r4"><span class="rf-for">長期の歳差の計算と試験値</span><span class="rf-src">IAU SOFA Board, <i>IAU SOFA Software Collection</i>, iauLtpequ</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r5"><span class="rf-for">ステレオ図法</span><span class="rf-src">J. P. Snyder, <i>Map Projections—A Working Manual</i>, U.S. Geological Survey Professional Paper 1395, 1987</span></li>
  <li id="thy-r6"><span class="rf-for">星座線と星座名</span><span class="rf-src">O. Frohn, <i>d3-celestial</i>, constellations.lines.json・constellations.json（BSD 3-Clause）</span></li>
